# Keep LF line endings in the working tree on every platform. On Windows,
# core.autocrlf=true would otherwise check files out with CRLF, which breaks scripts
# run inside Linux containers (e.g. the Postgres initdb script) and source-parsing
# tests. Windows batch files are the exception.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
